#section{Stargazer Handbook}::

#strong{Stargazer} is a fictional telescope-time scheduler; this handbook is
the YAMD example project. Every chapter exercises a slice of the language —
the source under #tt{examples/book/} is meant to be read next to its output.

Cross-references span the whole set: the #ref("plan") linked here is defined
in the protocol chapter, two files away and later in reading order.

